Subject: Re: Interpretation lavTestscore() and partable() functions for partial measurement invariance
Message-ID: <AaILttPQFGs.Z14zmLAIBAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <AaILttPQFGs.K5OKI6nDAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <AaILttPQFGs.K5OKI6nDAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
